WEBVTT

00:06:58.036 --> 00:07:03.876
Each new town will have a population size
of around 150,000 to 200,000,

00:07:03.916 --> 00:07:06.676
occasionally up to 300,000 people.

00:07:06.716 --> 00:07:08.076
And below the new town,

00:07:08.116 --> 00:07:09.396
we have neighborhoods;

00:07:09.436 --> 00:07:12.236
below the neighborhoods,
we have precincts.

00:07:12.236 --> 00:07:13.916
That's how Singapore was planned.

00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:17.156
You see, if you take
a city like Singapore,

00:07:17.196 --> 00:07:20.756
it would take, for example,

00:07:20.796 --> 00:07:27.676
the highest level
of commercial center is CBD,

00:07:28.756 --> 00:07:31.156
in the central part of Singapore.